abap2ui5.previewThemes.markdownDescription:
Additional UI5 themes the preview's theme picker offers, merged after the built-in list - for a custom theme deployed on your system.

```json
[
  { "value": "my_company_theme", "label": "Company Theme" }
]
```

abap2ui5.previewLanguages.markdownDescription:
Additional logon languages the preview's language picker offers, merged after the built-in list - passed to the app as `sap-language`.

```json
[
  { "value": "CS", "label": "Czech" }
]
```
